 # Changelog
 
 ## 1.0.0
-- Built the Northstar Websites theme with responsive templates, header panels, forms, newsletter management, local assets, and compiled production bundles.
+- Built the Evergreen Yardworks theme with responsive lawn-care templates, service panels, estimate forms, seasonal guide content, seeded stock photos, local interface icons, and compiled production bundles.
 
