 # Changelog
 
 ## 1.0.0
-- Built the Northstar Websites theme with responsive templates, header panels, forms, newsletter management, local assets, and compiled production bundles.
+- Built the Evergreen Yardworks theme with responsive lawn-care templates, service panels, estimate forms, seasonal guide content, seeded stock photos, local interface icons, and compiled production bundles.
 
diff --git a/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/README.md b/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/README.md
index f66f3418336e47b1b4cf46a2947a2c152d4dda05..4ac96e555f28eba12530d14e381c5fffdf69b92d
--- a/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/README.md
+++ b/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/README.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-# Northstar Websites WordPress Theme
+# Evergreen Yardworks WordPress Theme
 
-Northstar Websites is a modern service-business WordPress theme for website design, build, support, work examples, resources, contact forms, and newsletter signup.
+Evergreen Yardworks is a warm, photo-led WordPress theme for residential lawn care, landscaping maintenance, seasonal cleanup, recurring property plans, and estimate requests.
 
 The homepage is implemented in `front-page.php`. Page templates live in `page-templates/`; reusable sections live in `template-parts/`; PHP modules live in `inc/`; source assets live in `src/`; compiled bundles are `assets/css/bundle.css` and `assets/js/bundle.js`.
 
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 
 ## Features
 
-The theme includes desktop menu panels with rail hover/focus behavior, a mobile drawer with accordions, portfolio filtering, FAQ accordions, contact and service inquiry forms, private admin submission storage, newsletter subscriber management, responsive footer widgets, and policy-page routing.
+The theme includes desktop service and plan panels with rail hover/focus behavior, a mobile drawer with accordions, service selectors, seasonal tabs, portfolio filtering, FAQ accordions, estimate request forms, private admin submission storage, seasonal reminder signup management, responsive footer widgets, and policy-page routing.
 
 ## Accessibility
 
@@ -22,9 +22,9 @@
 
 ## Images And Licensing
 
-All current visual assets are original local SVG interface graphics stored in `assets/images/hero/`, `assets/images/portfolio/`, `assets/images/texture/`, and `assets/icons/`. No external runtime images, CDN fonts, API keys, or third-party logos are required.
+Seeded stock photos are stored in `assets/images/hero/`, `assets/images/portfolio/`, and `assets/images/texture/` and documented in `assets/images/asset-manifest.json`. Local SVG files in `assets/icons/` are interface marks only. No external runtime images, CDN fonts, API keys, or third-party logos are required.
 
 ## Known Limitations
 
-The theme manages newsletter subscribers but does not send bulk marketing campaigns. Policy pages render WordPress-managed content and do not provide legal text.
+The theme manages seasonal reminder subscribers but does not send bulk campaigns. Policy pages render WordPress-managed content and do not provide legal text.
 
diff --git a/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/accessibility/README.md b/wp-content/themes/005_nolan_young_theme_evergreen_yardworks/accessibility/README.md
